  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v8-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "2bc788c8bbe3c14411fcf1f16ce71ae700f063d7d9d5a3f14fe16bf979207d85",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f791daf25fa5f83ec147d02fd75f37781aac21eb60f75dc9a7166536ac7a4d6c",
      "text": "悟空的\n摇摇晃晃\n自行车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d1a9738caefdde9aab62e838106faa9eaea06be8edec9c3487d8a2347cf8bbf",
      "text": "“哇，他们骑得多神气！”\n悟空的尾巴高高翘起来。\n“我也想骑！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bc12c8f6900a55a900fcbd5fc9a68c053b7fd2ef120cfb80afe5d7dc5cee5afa",
      "text": "悟空戴上头盔。\n“准备好啦！”\n“嗯……戴反了！”\n悟空咯咯笑。\n“再试一次！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "755cff4c8dce891d89b239f999ec3f3a9304c7c16756930941133fe592c58226",
      "text": "悟空用脚蹬着地。\n蹬一下，滑一段。\n“哈哈，像滑板车一样！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b9f49f5867b75bca9ed09b2e3b97367dee7e5f804bf7315c4f2536e9d5c13600",
      "text": "双脚刚抬起来，\n车就左晃右晃。\n扑通，坐进草丛里！\n“哎哟，草地接住我啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "beb1bf66cf13406e4872135cb505e15084a89f39339300f1cace276b5744628a",
      "text": "“按按铃，也许就不晃啦。”\n叮铃！叮铃！\n铃铛倒是响了，\n车子还是晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9416c073cbc87a9d051f4dbada4ef8f983dea8d97dd69f577857b5f47b29e195",
      "text": "八戒扶住车座。\n“眼睛看前面，慢慢来。”\n玉兔在旁边喊：\n“你能行！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eaa9f5e194e5f4f47fb08de6a0782715c065eb3e0f7e0b64dddac54479c9b5a8",
      "text": "悟空又试了一次。\n蹬地，出发！\n踩一下脚踏板，\n再踩一下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8280e199f5840ae77c9999a34273fc12d66cd5367bd6862b7e2bf8a90158d1a8",
      "text": "他往左边晃，\n尾巴往右边晃。\n“我的尾巴也在学呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea08a6783495a16433a5f6cd248251693ef2c33e3dc41b69908e7e8907a77878",
      "text": "他每天都练一会儿。\n有时只能骑一小段，\n有时还是晃呀晃。\n他每天都再试一试。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "18541e326f96b6d401a79e2e217c4f457422821946188372e8be29ff644f638d",
      "text": "有一天傍晚……\n八戒松开了手。\n悟空还在往前骑！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98aa5d9f437c0fca4a659ec785d88da8c8bc8e61626ff8b9a5630e85fd77646a",
      "text": "“我会骑啦！”\n他的围巾飘呀飘，\n尾巴绕了个圈。\n悟空高兴得不得了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3fc90ea57c35cd2783e966d998e4c80bfa2759a86ce554031c785e1c3a446e6c",
      "text": "他学会了转弯，\n也学会了停车——\n就停在水坑前。\n“小鸭子，你先走。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d4172fbf78f1703edb655b12ad6115b9791439b9a6d9ec1d9d0988e8a883aba",
      "text": "现在，他们一起骑车。\n不着急，\n轮子骨碌碌地转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "51631bab397eb70552c274d2f1be6f481751fdd8204c8ba79d8babe7a8581b39",
      "text": "回到家，悟空停好车。\n“晚安，小自行车。\n今天就骑到这儿啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78d01234644448a48e170715707e86a92b3c6711aa5ed0d9373cc65cf5014e5e",
      "text": "悟空在床上蜷成一团。\n梦里的小路平平整整，\n轮子轻轻地说：\n“嘘……”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
